  "description": "Project templates for Polhem. `dotnet new polhem-avalonia` creates a JSON-RPC server and Avalonia clients; `dotnet new polhem-blazor-server` and `dotnet new polhem-blazor-server-fluent` create one Blazor Server site, on MudBlazor or on Fluent UI, that runs the backend in its own process. `dotnet new polhem-blazor-wasm` and `dotnet new polhem-blazor-wasm-fluent` create a server that serves the JSON-RPC API and a Blazor WebAssembly client from one origin. Each references the Polhem packages and the driver of the chosen database, with a definition folder, the DefineEditor and DbManager tools, and VS Code tasks that initialize the database and open DefineEditor.",
